g/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5j/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render paired return links in Markdown PDFs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: add a second pandoc Lua filter plus TeX macros that resolve, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tag, and pair every eligible same-document link with a return-pill row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]at its target, unify the link ink, report pairing counts and dead-link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warnings from bob, and cover it with filter, XeLaTeX, and CLI tests plus[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Keep return-link glyphs out of synced highlights[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]export[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]export: stamp a `return_links: true` marker key on PDFs that actually [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]carry return links, register it as a standard synced field, and strip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tag glyphs and pill text from highlight text when `bob ref sync` renders[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the note region for those PDFs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5j","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5j.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-69e1d6b1e8a3ed6d18ffbe5e7c019516","started_at":"2026-10-07T18:46:52.574844+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"388036b8229451536304883b51f6fb2da869a7f6d18b58d2e178f718bd11c1b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.at